{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03014","headline":"荆州作二首 二 · 张九龄","name":"荆州作二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千载一遭遇，往贤所至难。\n问余奚爲者，无阶忽上抟。\n明圣不世出，翼亮非苟安。\n崇高自有配，孤陋何足干。\n遇恩一时来，窃位三岁寒。\n谁谓诚不尽，知穷力亦殚。\n虽至负乘寇，初无挟术钻。\n浩荡出江湖，翻覆如波澜。\n心伤不材树，自念独飞翰。\n徇义在匹夫，报恩犹一餐。\n况乃山海泽，效无毫发端。\n内讼已慙沮，积毁今摧残。\n胡爲复惕息，伤鸟畏虚弹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03014.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03014","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}